{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4ae152610571a224","name":"Navicomputer","source":{"id":"source:reference-4ae152610571a224","title":"Navicomputer","revision":18761,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:41:16Z","sha256":"1731a7d8a921ed32cb166b3d89cdd8e8361f6ceec0cc6980515bf3803bbf341b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18761","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Navicomputer&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4ae152610571a224","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAVICOMPUTER\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EP\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["AVAILABILITY\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Limited\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["500\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Standard\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2,000\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Advanced\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20,000\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["A Navicomputer is an astrogation calculator designed to make all the calculations necessary to travel through Hyperspace. Most ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," have Navicomputers, but those that lack ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrives"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrives"}," and some fighters that depend on Astromech Droids do not.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though extremely expensive, Advanced Navicomputers exist. These grant a +10 bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," checks made for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Astrogation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Astrogation"},", rather than a typical Navicomputer's +5 bonus. Additionally, a character aboard a ship that has a Navicomputer need not be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," skill to make use of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Astrogation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Astrogation"}," aspect of the skill.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Navicomputers in Starfighters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Most Navicomputers are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonstandard Modifications"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonstandard_Modifications"}," for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},"- these ships simply don't have the room for the memory core required to store and track the locations of untold billions of celestial objects. Instead, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," often have Limited Navicomputers that store only two jumps' worth of information, enough to get to a destination and return. Some Limited Navicomputers have a greater memory capacity, but these are rare and more expensive.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
